                  "id": "CrdF2",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$text-dim",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Quadra does that one job. Drag four handles around what should be a rectangle, draw a line along what should be level, and watch the result update live.",
